// Package partnermanager composes currently authorized partner customer,
// operator and worker use cases through typed owning services. It keeps actor
// and target identities separate, requires explicit dependencies and commercial
// controls, and preserves immutable signup/payment evidence during recovery.
// Scoped operator previews apply prospective attribution with immutable request
// receipts, unchanged prior financial history and a signup-anchored end date.
// Retained relationship reads project safe customer ownership periods; private
// payment cohort reports require host projections and current scoped authority.
// Page-scoped referral summaries join independent owning snapshots and reject
// observed on-page changes; missing acceptance omits customer amount fields.
// Explicit same-revenue-owner reporting adds frozen eligible paid/net-positive
// relationship counts and fresh current status with truthful unknown coverage.
// Optional complete partner paid metrics join one complete relationship/binding
// snapshot and one billing history read, independently of referral pages.
// A complete revision recheck detects observed membership/ownership changes;
// bounded optional status I/O keeps deferred candidates explicitly unknown.
// Original-payment cohorts never stand in for signup/visit conversion rates.
// Separate original-cohort conversion reports combine complete traffic and
// ownership with one billing history read, then recheck evidence and authority.
// Measured/unmeasured signups, visits and manual/correction events stay distinct;
// plan overlaps remain private, rates reflect retained evidence and renewals
// cannot inflate conversion. Host Overview/transport adoption remains explicit.
// Renewals are allocation rows, not new people; former owners retain history
// without receiving current subscriber identity or lifecycle observations.
// Financial summaries project only aggregate commission; privileged domain
// metrics retain frozen-plan breakdowns and distinguish period movements from
// unfiltered current obligations and potentially sent claim exposure.
// Aggregate due maturity remains visible under the same current authority,
// independently of cohort filters; deadlines do not promise claim availability.
// Consent-gated visit preparation keeps signed measurement and signup cookies
// separate. Aggregate referral analytics recheck current reporting authority
// without disclosing referred customer or measured origin identities.
// Its optional bounded Worker commits decisions before owning-feed acceptance
// and retains unresolved sources with durable fenced leases and retry schedules.
// Maturity work freezes the earnings deadline, requires the same scoped earnings
// feed and dedicated current partner authority, and recovers actual financial
// receipts before deciding or completing. Future unattempted jobs are delayed,
// separately from attempted backoff; maturity never submits a payout.
// Optional program-scoped operations reporting exposes complete bounded pending
// scheduling counts, independently of commercial admission. An empty discovered
// queue does not establish source discovery or financial maturity completeness.
// Host transport, worker scheduling and deployment remain explicit composition.
// See README.md for capability ownership, identity adaptation and limitations.
package partnermanager
